#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:182
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_GymGuideAdvice"
msgid ""
"Hey, how's it going, CHAMPION-\n"
"bound {PLAYER}?\p"
"LAVARIDGE's GYM LEADER FLANNERY\n"
"uses FIRE-type POKéMON.\p"
"Her passion for POKéMON burns stronger\n"
"and hotter than a volcano.\p"
"Don't get too close to her--you'll burn!\n"
"Hose her down with water and then\l"
"go for it!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，最近怎么样？\n"
"以冠军为目标的{PLAYER}！\p"
"釜炎道馆的馆主亚莎使用的\n"
"是火属性宝可梦。\p"
"她对宝可梦的热情比火山还要强烈、\n"
"还要炽热。\p"
"可别离她太近，会被烧伤的！\n"
"先用水浇她一身，然后再上吧！$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:193
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_GymGuidePostVictory"
msgid "Yow! That was a scorching-hot battle!$"
msgstr "哇！真是一场火热的对战！$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:196
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_ColeIntro"
msgid ""
"Owowowowow!\n"
"Yikes, it's hot!$"
msgstr "哎哟哟哟哟！好烫啊！$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:200
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_ColeDefeat"
msgid "I'm blinded by sweat in my eyes…$"
msgstr "汗流进眼睛里，什么都看不见了……$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:203
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_ColePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Being buried in hot sand promotes\n"
"circulation.\p"
"It's effective for healing pain in\n"
"your joints.$"
msgstr ""
"把身体埋在热沙里能促进血液循环。\p"
"对治疗关节疼痛很有效哦。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:209
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_AxleIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm trying to relieve my stress.\n"
"Don't come along and stress me out!$"
msgstr "我正在消除压力呢。别过来给我添堵！$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:213
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_AxleDefeat"
msgid "I hope FLANNERY flames you good!$"
msgstr "希望亚莎狠狠地烧你一顿！$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:216
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_AxlePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Haaah… Whew…\p"
"If you spend too much time buried in\n"
"hot sand, it tuckers you out…$"
msgstr ""
"哈啊……呼……\p"
"在热沙里埋太久，会让人筋疲力尽的……$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:221
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_B1F_Text_KeeganIntro"
msgid ""
"You must be getting tired by now.\n"
"You'd like to rest in the hot sand,\l"
"wouldn't you?\p"
"But you should know that maintaining\n"
"your willpower is an important ability\l"
"for all TRAINERS.$"
msgstr ""
"你现在一定累了吧。\n"
"很想在热沙里休息一下，对不对？\p"
"但你要知道，保持意志力是\n"
"所有训练家都必须具备的重要能力。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:229
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_B1F_Text_KeeganDefeat"
msgid "Play with fire, and be burned…$"
msgstr "玩火者必自焚……$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:232
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_B1F_Text_KeeganPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Your skill is real…\n"
"But our LEADER FLANNERY is strong.\p"
"If you don't watch yourself, you'll be\n"
"burned seriously.$"
msgstr ""
"你的实力是货真价实的……\n"
"但我们的馆主亚莎很强。\p"
"要是不小心点，你会被烧得很惨的。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:238
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_GeraldIntro"
msgid ""
"Can your POKéMON withstand\n"
"392-degree heat?$"
msgstr "你的宝可梦能承受392度的高温吗？$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:242
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_GeraldDefeat"
msgid "It didn't burn hotly enough…$"
msgstr "烧得还不够旺……$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:245
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_GeraldPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The temperature of magma is\n"
"392 degrees.\p"
"Your POKéMON beat me, so they should\n"
"easily survive in magma.$"
msgstr ""
"岩浆的温度是392度。\p"
"你的宝可梦打败了我，\n"
"在岩浆里应该也能轻松活下来吧。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:251
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_DanielleIntro"
msgid ""
"Um…\n"
"Okay, I'll battle with you.$"
msgstr "嗯……好吧，我来和你对战。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:255
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_DanielleDefeat"
msgid "Oh, but you're too strong.$"
msgstr "哎呀，可是你太强了。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:258
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_DaniellePostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'm going to be a pretty and strong\n"
"TRAINER just like FLANNERY.$"
msgstr ""
"我要成为像亚莎那样又\n"
"漂亮又强大的训练家。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:262
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_B1F_Text_JaceIntro"
msgid ""
"Come on, get with it!\n"
"Let's go before my feelings cool!$"
msgstr ""
"快点，打起精神来！\n"
"趁我的热情还没冷却，赶紧开始吧！$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:266
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_B1F_Text_JaceDefeat"
msgid ""
"It's so hot, and yet my heart is\n"
"clutched by ice…$"
msgstr ""
"明明这么热，\n"
"我的心却像被冰冻住了……$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:270
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_B1F_Text_JacePostBattle"
msgid ""
"The way the battling spirit burns\n"
"within you, you may stand a chance\l"
"against our LEADER.$"
msgstr ""
"看你心中燃烧着的斗志，\n"
"说不定能和我们馆主一较高下。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:275
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_B1F_Text_JeffIntro"
msgid ""
"See how the flames blaze wildly?\n"
"They flare in anticipation of my win!$"
msgstr ""
"看到火焰烧得多猛烈了吗？\n"
"那是在期待我的胜利！$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:279
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_B1F_Text_JeffDefeat"
msgid "Something didn't go right.$"
msgstr "有什么地方出错了。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:282
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_B1F_Text_JeffPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Well, so what? I say so what?\n"
"I can walk on hot coals barefoot!\p"
"…Don't even think about trying it!$"
msgstr ""
"那又怎样？我说那又怎样？\n"
"我可以光着脚在烧红的炭上走！\p"
"……你可千万别想着去试啊！$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:287
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_B1F_Text_EliIntro"
msgid ""
"As much as I love mountains,\n"
"I especially love volcanoes.$"
msgstr "我很喜欢山，尤其喜欢火山。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:291
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_B1F_Text_EliDefeat"
msgid ""
"Well, it seems to me I lost without\n"
"ever being in control.$"
msgstr ""
"看来我从头到尾都\n"
"没能掌握局面就输了。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:295
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_B1F_Text_EliPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I stay here because I became a fan\n"
"of FLANNERY's power.\p"
"Hehehehe.$"
msgstr ""
"我待在这里，\n"
"是因为我成了亚莎力量的粉丝。\p"
"嘿嘿嘿嘿。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:300
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_FlanneryIntro"
msgid ""
"Welcome… No, wait.\p"
"Puny TRAINER, how good to see you've\n"
"made it here!\p"
"I have been entrusted with the…\n"
"No, wait.\p"
"I am FLANNERY, and I'm the GYM\n"
"LEADER here!\p"
"Uh…\n"
"Dare not underestimate me, though\l"
"I have been LEADER only a short time!\p"
"With skills inherited from my grand-\n"
"father, I shall, uh…demonstrate the\l"
"hot moves we have honed on this land!$"
msgstr ""
"欢迎……不对，等等。\p"
"弱小的训练家，\n"
"很高兴看到你能来到这里！\p"
"我被托付了……不对，等等。\p"
"我是亚莎，是这里的道馆馆主！\p"
"呃……虽然我当馆主的时间还不长，\n"
"但可别小看我！\p"
"我会用从爷爷那里继承来的技术，\n"
"呃……向你展示我们在\l"
"这片土地上磨练出的火热招式！$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:315
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_FlanneryDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh…\n"
"I guess I was trying too hard…\p"
"I… I've only recently become\n"
"a GYM LEADER.\p"
"I tried too hard to be someone\n"
"I'm not.\p"
"I have to do things my natural way. If\n"
"I don't, my POKéMON will be confused.\p"
"Thanks for teaching me that.\n"
"For that, you deserve this.$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀……看来我太勉强自己了……\p"
"我……我才刚当上道馆馆主没多久。\p"
"我太想变成另一个不是自己的人了。\p"
"我必须按照自己本来的\n"
"样子去做才行。不然的话，\l"
"我的宝可梦也会感到困惑的。\p"
"谢谢你让我明白了这一点。\n"
"这个是你应得的。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:327
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_ReceivedHeatBadge"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} received the HEAT BADGE\n"
"from FLANNERY.$"
msgstr "{PLAYER}从亚莎那里得到了火山徽章。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:331
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_ExplainHeatBadgeTakeThis"
msgid ""
"If you have a HEAT BADGE, all POKéMON\n"
"up to Level 50, even those you get in\l"
"trades from other people, will obey\l"
"you completely.\p"
"And, it lets POKéMON use the HM move\n"
"STRENGTH outside of battle.\p"
"This is a token of my appreciation.\n"
"Don't be shy about taking it!$"
msgstr ""
"只要有火山徽章，等级50以下的宝可梦，\n"
"就算是通过和别人交换得到的，\l"
"也会完全听从你的指令。\p"
"而且，宝可梦还能在\n"
"战斗以外使用秘传招式怪力。\p"
"这是我的一点谢意。不用客气，收下吧！$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:341
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_ExplainOverheat"
msgid ""
"That TM50 contains OVERHEAT.\p"
"That move inflicts serious damage on\n"
"the opponent.\p"
"But it also sharply cuts the SP. ATK\n"
"of the POKéMON using it. It might not\l"
"be suitable for longer battles.$"
msgstr ""
"那个招式学习器50里面是过热。\p"
"这个招式能给对手造成巨大的伤害。\p"
"但使用它的宝可梦特攻也会大幅降低。\n"
"可能不太适合长时间的战斗。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:349
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_RegisteredFlannery"
msgid ""
"Registered GYM LEADER FLANNERY\n"
"in the POKéNAV.$"
msgstr "在宝可梦导航里登记了道馆馆主亚莎。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:353
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_FlanneryPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Your power reminds me of someone…\p"
"Oh! I know! You battle like NORMAN,\n"
"the GYM LEADER of PETALBURG.$"
msgstr ""
"你的力量让我想起了某个人……\p"
"啊！我知道了！你的\n"
"战斗方式很像橙华道馆的馆主千里。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:358
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_GymStatue"
msgid "LAVARIDGE TOWN POKéMON GYM$"
msgstr "釜炎乡宝可梦道馆$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:361
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_GymStatueCertified"
msgid ""
"LAVARIDGE TOWN POKéMON GYM\p"
"FLANNERY'S CERTIFIED TRAINERS:\n"
"{PLAYER}$"
msgstr ""
"釜炎乡宝可梦道馆\n"
"亚莎认可的训练家：\l"
"{PLAYER}$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:366
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_FlanneryPreRematch"
msgid ""
"FLANNERY: Losing a battle isn't going\n"
"to deflate me.\p"
"I love POKéMON.\n"
"I love to battle.\l"
"And… I love this GYM!\p"
"Let's exchange superhot moves\n"
"in another battle!$"
msgstr ""
"亚莎：输掉一场对战可不会让我泄气。\p"
"我喜欢宝可梦，喜欢对战，\n"
"还有……我喜欢这座道馆！\p"
"让我们再来一场对战，\n"
"互相切磋超火热的招式吧！$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:375
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_FlanneryRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"Whew!\n"
"On the verge of eruption!$"
msgstr "呼！差点就要喷发了！$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:379
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_FlanneryPostRematch"
msgid ""
"FLANNERY: I lost the match,\n"
"but I'm completely satisfied.\p"
"It's not often I get to enjoy a battle\n"
"this heated.\p"
"Let's have another one like this\n"
"again sometime!$"
msgstr ""
"亚莎：虽然我输了比赛，\n"
"但我完全心满意足了。\p"
"能享受这么火热的对战，\n"
"可不是常有的事。\p"
"下次再来一场这样的对战吧！$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:387
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_FlanneryRematchNeedTwoMons"
msgid ""
"FLANNERY: Losing a battle isn't going\n"
"to deflate me.\p"
"I love POKéMON.\n"
"I love to battle.\l"
"And… I love this GYM!\p"
"Let's exchange superhot moves\n"
"in another battle!\p"
"Oh, wait. Do you only have one POKéMON\n"
"that can battle?\p"
"I hate to say this, but when you come\n"
"see me, bring at least two POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"亚莎：输掉一场对战可不会让我泄气。\p"
"我喜欢宝可梦，喜欢对战，\n"
"还有……我喜欢这座道馆！\p"
"让我们再来一场对战，\n"
"互相切磋超火热的招式吧！\p"
"哎呀，等一下。\n"
"你只有一只能战斗的宝可梦吗？\p"
"虽然不想这么说，但来找我的时候，\n"
"请至少带上两只宝可梦。$"
